{"meta":{"id":"tt31314751","type":"series","name":"All Her Fault","description":"Marissa Irvine llega para recoger a su pequeño hijo Milo de su primera cita de juegos, pero la mujer que le abre la puerta no es una madre que ella reconozca. No tiene a Milo y nunca ha oído hablar de él... A medida que la peor pesadilla de todo padre comienza a revelarse, nuevas preguntas conducen a profundos secretos, revelando grietas en el mundo aparentemente perfecto de Irvine hasta que todo queda hecho añicos.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rXimJTvyUsXRhPI3SD2B0sltUUX.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uv0LVwNM8mZcwhCa5pd6FJxvKDz.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zLIzAXq3bsIMduGbBCVAJRaniwd.png","genres":["Misterio","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"2025-2025","released":"2025-11-07T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"8.0","trailers":[{"source":"J9y_QvRwu64","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["Sarah Snook","Jake Lacy","Sophia Lillis","Michael Peña","Dakota Fanning","Abby Elliott","Jay Ellis","Duke McCloud"],"director":["Megan Gallagher"],"writer":["Andrea Mara"],"links":[{"name":"Sarah Snook","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Sarah%20Snook"},{"name":"Jake Lacy","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jake%20Lacy"},{"name":"Sophia Lillis","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Sophia%20Lillis"},{"name":"Michael Peña","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Michael%20Pe%C3%B1a"},{"name":"Dakota Fanning","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Dakota%20Fanning"},{"name":"Abby Elliott","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Abby%20Elliott"},{"name":"Jay Ellis","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Jay%20Ellis"},{"name":"Duke McCloud","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Duke%20McCloud"},{"name":"Megan Gallagher","category":"Directors","url":"stremio:///search?search=Megan%20Gallagher"},{"name":"Andrea Mara","category":"Writers","url":"stremio:///search?search=Andrea%20Ma